  "_doc": [
    "The ONE closing-ref truth table (issue #5763, epic #5762).",
    "Each row is a PR body and the two answers the PR refs module gives for it:",
    "  closing    - issue numbers the body CLOSES (closing verb, negation-guarded), in body order, de-duplicated",
    "  referenced - issue numbers the body REFERENCES (closing verb OR Ref(s) #N; a negated ref still counts), in body order, de-duplicated",
    "  doesNotClose (optional) - extra issue numbers the does-this-body-close-N predicate must answer false for (digit-boundary probes)",
    "test/github-pr-refs.test.mts drives BOTH src/github/pr-refs.ts and scripts/autopilot/pr-refs.py from these rows; a row where the two disagree fails the suite.",
    "Non-ASCII bodies are written as \\u escapes so the row is readable in any editor."
  ],
